begin main()
b := 0 ^ (0 + 12)
1 := b ^ (0 + 0) // should fail here
end main()

/*
The arithmetic assignment (line 3) destroys variable 'b' and therefore asserts that 1 == b but b is 12 (see line 2).
Should fail with:

Failed assertion: Value 12 is not equals target 1.
	at Forward.main(../tests/rssa/vm/assertions/variable-destruction.rssa:3)
*/
